# Phase-Wise Plan: Unified Smart Compass (Smiley Long-Press Upgrade)

## Context

The **smiley long-press** currently opens `WellbeingBreakdownSheet` — a sheet with 4 dimension bars and a causal narrative drawn entirely from 12 canned template strings (`CausalNarrativeResolver`). Zero AI.

Meanwhile, `DailyInsight` (AI-generated every morning by `generateDailyBriefing`) contains a personalized headline, correlation cards, nudge, and weekly trend. This content is visible only via the Morning Briefing card → Today's Compass. The smiley long-press never sees it.

**Goal**: Route smiley long-press to the existing `BriefingDetailView` (Today's Compass), extended with the 4 live dimension bars. One scroll gives AI explanation + data breakdown. `WellbeingBreakdownSheet` is soft-deprecated to a fallback for the "no insight yet today" case.

---

## Decisions (user-confirmed)

| Decision | Choice |
|---|---|
| AI freshness | Once per day (morning briefing). Dimension bars stay live (local synthesis). |
| Sheet unification | Upgrade `BriefingDetailView` — smiley long-press routes there |
| Correlation cards | Surface in merged sheet (already in BriefingDetailView) |
| Refresh button | Already exists in BriefingDetailView (↻); retained |

---

## What Changes

### New section in BriefingDetailView — Dimension Bars

`BriefingDetailView` gains an optional `liveBreakdown: WellbeingBreakdownSheetContract?` parameter. When non-nil, renders a **"TODAY'S SCORES"** section between `nudgeSection` and `weeklyTrendSection` showing all 4 dimension bars (Physical / Emotional / Clarity / Momentum with %-filled bars).

`DailyInsight.dimensions` is always `.neutral` on the server path — live dimensions must come from `WellbeingBreakdownSheetContract` (synthesis-computed in `MainViewModel+Navigation.wellbeingBreakdownContract`).

### WellbeingDimensionBar extraction

`WellbeingDimensionBar` is currently `private struct` inside `WellbeingBreakdownSheet.swift`. Extract to `Components/WellbeingDimensionBar.swift` (non-private) so both sheets can reuse it.

### Routing change in handleSmileyLongPress()

```swift
// BEFORE
if self.isViewingToday || self.wellbeingBreakdownContract != nil {
    self.showBreakdownSheet = true
} else {
    self.showInsightSheet = true
}

// AFTER
if self.hasInsightAvailable {
    self.showBriefingSheet = true          // merged view (AI + dimension bars)
} else if self.isViewingToday {
    self.triggerInsightGeneration()
    self.showBreakdownSheet = true         // fallback: local bars while briefing generates
}
// Past day + no insight: guard at top already blocks this
```

`showBreakdownSheet` and `WellbeingBreakdownSheet` are retained as a fallback — not deleted this sprint. Deletion is a future cleanup task once briefing reliability is validated.

### MainScreenSheets wiring

Pass live breakdown to BriefingDetailView:
```swift
BriefingDetailView(
    insight: insight,
    liveBreakdown: self.viewModel.wellbeingBreakdownContract,   // ← new
    onDismiss: { self.viewModel.showBriefingSheet = false },
    onRefresh: {
        self.viewModel.showBriefingSheet = false
        self.viewModel.triggerInsightGeneration(force: true)
    }
)
```

